Текст: 'It turns out that when the muscle has been quiet for a while, a part of it (called the muscle spindle) can make the neurons more likely to have spontaneous action potentials—when you’ve been still for a long while,your muscles get twitchy, just so the battery doesn’t run down.[*]Another case where a mechanistic, deterministic regulatory loop can make indeterministic events more likely.'
